{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:57 2026-11-04 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:57 2026-11-04 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:57 2026-11-04 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e3478f8b667917c54e2380b57d24c834/2026-11/007_0.png\"/><p>北角發生交通意外。今日（4日）晚上10時許，一輛中型貨車沿英皇道往筲箕灣方向行駛，至新光戲院對開時撞到一名40多歲女子。她應聲倒地，昏迷不醒，由救護車送往東區醫院搶救，警方正調查事件。</p><img alt=\"一名40多歲女子被中型貨車撞倒，昏迷不醒。網上圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a7b6ab412070cfdf861a27c04987f9c8/2026-11/885361000_1809441890362877_3621471284818304436_n.jpg\" title=\"一名40多歲女子被中型貨車撞倒，昏迷不醒。網上圖片\"/><p>一名40多歲女子被中型貨車撞倒，昏迷不醒。網上圖片</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:26:37.153558+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T14:57:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:33.353968+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:33.353968+00:00","content_hash":"86ff17173de79f11cd2b2e723702f166a55a8f77647dbf42ef119fb03a9dd794","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}